    "rationale": "Four internal nodes (13,15,16) and output 3 are moved vertically down by 2 tiles to y=27/30/33, aligning with vacancy hotspots in windows 25–27/28–29 and 25–27/31–32 where combined density is near zero. This reduces max_y from 35 to 33, shrinking height from 16 to 14 while preserving fanin proximity: node 12 remains at (24,26), so edges 12→13 and 12→15 become vertical (Δy=1, Manhattan=1), eliminating previous detours; edge 13→16 shortens from 3 to 3 steps but gains straighter path; edge 15→3 and 16→3 contract by 2 steps each. The left/right bounds stay unchanged (x=20–28), so area drops to 9×14=126 tiles. All moves respect neighbor anchors (e.g., node 13’s median was [24,26], now [24,27] improves vertical alignment with 12 and 16). No node collisions; ports remain movable within envelope."
